WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.780
Open any Check and press Edit, and you land on its Overview page.

2
00:00:05.500 --> 00:00:09.600
Duplicate makes a copy you can rename and change without touching the original.

3
00:00:10.340 --> 00:00:14.860
Edit questions says Needs setup until your Check has some questions.

4
00:00:15.640 --> 00:00:19.860
Question sources show where your questions came from, like a PDF or

5
00:00:19.860 --> 00:00:21.000
a document that you uploaded.

6
00:00:21.660 --> 00:00:26.900
Your sentences are paragraphs you always write, or depending on an

7
00:00:26.900 --> 00:00:30.680
answer to a question, used only when a walk needs them.

8
00:00:30.680 --> 00:00:34.400
They work in the same way as the question sources, where you upload

9
00:00:34.400 --> 00:00:37.740
a document and Quickler sets them up from it.

10
00:00:37.740 --> 00:00:41.680
The written report turns each Record into a finished document, in a

11
00:00:41.680 --> 00:00:46.260
PDF or a Word document, laid out in sections like any report.

12
00:00:47.260 --> 00:00:51.880
This is particularly useful and intended for when you want to upload

13
00:00:51.880 --> 00:00:55.240
a finished report of yours, and Quickler will use your own layout.

14
00:00:55.240 --> 00:00:59.520
Edit where answers go shows where each answer lands in that layout.

15
00:01:00.400 --> 00:01:05.220
Under Who and when, Phone access sets the times this Check can be done.

16
00:01:05.860 --> 00:01:08.300
Contacts sets who this Check is for.

17
00:01:09.480 --> 00:01:13.560
If you choose Nobody, then anyone with a phone number on your

18
00:01:13.560 --> 00:01:15.780
account can do it.

19
00:01:15.780 --> 00:01:19.780
If you choose People with a phone number, only those people you

20
00:01:19.780 --> 00:01:21.780
select can do it on WhatsApp or Telegram.

21
00:01:21.780 --> 00:01:26.080
If you choose people who have emails on the account, they will get

22
00:01:26.080 --> 00:01:31.760
sent an email with the Record when Tell managers is turned on.

23
00:01:32.520 --> 00:01:35.400
Several people can do the same Check at the same time.

24
00:01:35.400 --> 00:01:38.480
Send now sends the Check to one person straight away.

25
00:01:39.180 --> 00:01:43.660
Something urgent, like a safety Fault, is sent to managers straight away.

26
00:01:43.660 --> 00:01:47.440
To tidy up your Checks on the home page, you can use a folder.

27
00:01:47.440 --> 00:01:51.300
If you press New folder, you'll be able to give it a name and save it.

28
00:01:51.300 --> 00:01:53.820
You can drag a Check into a folder.

29
00:01:54.720 --> 00:01:57.240
You can rename a folder or delete it.

30
00:01:57.240 --> 00:01:59.720
The Checks and Records inside are never deleted.

31
00:02:00.440 --> 00:02:04.160
Some answers are worked out for you, like a total or a date.

32
00:02:04.160 --> 00:02:10.820
On a number question, you can press Add a sum and say in words what needs adding.

33
00:02:10.820 --> 00:02:14.480
You can then press Enter and Quickler turns it into a sum.

34
00:02:14.480 --> 00:02:19.020
On the Record, the answer is worked out, and you can still edit it,

35
00:02:19.020 --> 00:02:20.320
should you need to do so.
